## Notes
- LocalStack → real AWS SQS later = change `AWS_ENDPOINT_URL` env var only. No code touches.
- `region-router.js` falls back to single region if test config has no region tag (back-compat with Phase 0-8 builds).
- `budget-guard.js` runs **before** enqueue — rejection at API layer, not after wasting fleet spin-up.
- RBAC enforced twice on purpose: K8s RBAC = infra access control (who can `kubectl scale`). App-level RBAC = business action control (who can launch a $-costing test). Different blast radii.
- `migrations/` lives in `control-api` only — single owner of schema, avoids split-brain migrations.